[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16980.868, "timestamp": "04:43:00", "text": "好的。你知道吗，昨天我不小心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16984.99, "timestamp": "04:43:04", "text": "因为我使用了……，所以摧毁了任务区域。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16988.39, "timestamp": "04:43:08", "text": "伐木工。它是用木头做的。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16991.19, "timestamp": "04:43:11", "text": "他一丝不挂。一切都破碎了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16994.43, "timestamp": "04:43:14", "text": "我感到很难过。然后我开始摆放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16997.91, "timestamp": "04:43:17", "text": "一切。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17000.868, "timestamp": "04:43:20", "text": "你还记得我把药片放在哪儿了吗？经过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17004.948, "timestamp": "04:43:24", "text": "我们那里有一根柱子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17008.23, "timestamp": "04:43:28", "text": "我们应该把时间安排得像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17010.23, "timestamp": "04:43:30", "text": "放置标记，例如旗帜或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17012.39, "timestamp": "04:43:32", "text": "某种模组之类的东西。我们可以问。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17016.39, "timestamp": "04:43:36", "text": "我当时就想，我们到底要出多少个MOD？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17020.628, "timestamp": "04:43:40", "text": "问？这将影响服务器的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17036.708, "timestamp": "04:43:56", "text": "那种弹跳的、嗯，弹跳的声音，对吧？"}]